WEBVTT

00:00:09.252 --> 00:00:12.372
Listen, Buzz, forget about me.

00:00:12.452 --> 00:00:15.372
You should get outta here
while you can.

00:00:15.492 --> 00:00:17.972
(CHIRPING CONTINUES)

00:00:20.132 --> 00:00:22.132
(SIGHS)

00:00:24.492 --> 00:00:26.732
(CLATTERING)

00:00:26.812 --> 00:00:28.692
Buzz? What are you doin'?
I thought you were...

00:00:28.732 --> 00:00:31.812
Come on, sheriff. There's a kid
over in that house who needs us.

00:00:31.892 --> 00:00:33.852
Now let's get you out of this thing.
(GRUNTS)

00:00:33.892 --> 00:00:35.332
Yes, sir!

00:00:37.012 --> 00:00:40.052
-(STRAINING)
-Come on, Buzz. We can do it.

00:00:40.452 --> 00:00:43.492
-(GRUNTS)
-(ENGINE APPROACHING)

00:00:46.052 --> 00:00:47.892
Woody, it's the moving van.

00:00:47.932 --> 00:00:50.092
We gotta get outta here now.

00:00:51.052 --> 00:00:53.132
(GRUNTS)

00:00:54.892 --> 00:00:56.532
Come on, Buzz.

00:00:58.092 --> 00:01:00.292
All right. (GRUNTS)

00:01:00.812 --> 00:01:03.612
-Hey, I'm out!
-Almost there.

00:01:08.612 --> 00:01:10.932
(SPUTTERS)
I want to ride the pony.

00:01:11.052 --> 00:01:13.252
-(SNORES)
-Phew.

00:01:15.092 --> 00:01:18.652
Woody? Woody?
Are you all right?

00:01:19.532 --> 00:01:21.892
I'm fine. I'm okay.

00:01:21.972 --> 00:01:23.652
(RINGING)

00:01:25.892 --> 00:01:27.612
(RINGING CONTINUES)

00:01:28.452 --> 00:01:30.412
(RINGING CONTINUES)

00:01:30.452 --> 00:01:32.572
(CLOCK CLATTERS ON FLOOR,
RINGING STOPS)

00:01:32.612 --> 00:01:37.212
Oh, yeah!
Time for lift-off! Whoo!

00:01:39.052 --> 00:01:41.932
To infinity and beyond!

00:01:42.212 --> 00:01:44.132
Whoo-hoo!

00:01:47.892 --> 00:01:50.572
(GROWLS, BARKS, SNARLING)

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:53.172
-Aah! Back, back.
-(BARKS, YELPS)

00:01:53.252 --> 00:01:54.972
-Down, down!
-(BARKS)

00:01:55.652 --> 00:01:57.772
Okay, what do I do?
Come on, Woody. Think.

00:01:58.132 --> 00:02:00.132
(TOYS CLATTERING)

00:02:01.252 --> 00:02:02.292
Guys!

00:02:03.812 --> 00:02:06.452
No, no, no, no! Wait!
Wait. Listen, please.

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:11.052
There's a good toy down there, and he's
gonna be blown to bits in a few minutes.

00:02:11.132 --> 00:02:14.652
All because of me.
We gotta save him.

00:02:14.772 --> 00:02:17.452
And, uh...
But I need your help.

00:02:20.132 --> 00:02:21.932
(TOY CREAKING)

00:02:24.732 --> 00:02:27.572
Please. He's my friend.

00:02:28.612 --> 00:02:30.932
And he's the only one I've got.

00:02:33.252 --> 00:02:35.852
(TAPPING MORSE CODE)

00:02:37.652 --> 00:02:39.892
-(TOY TRUMPETING)
-(TAPPING CONTINUES)

00:02:44.212 --> 00:02:47.852
Thank you.
Okay, I think I know what to do.

00:02:47.972 --> 00:02:50.052
We're gonna have
to break a few rules.

00:02:50.132 --> 00:02:53.252
But if it works,
it'll help everybody.

00:03:00.692 --> 00:03:02.532
(SIGHS)

00:03:02.612 --> 00:03:04.052
(POUNDING)

00:03:04.132 --> 00:03:06.932
SID: Houston to Mission Control.
Come in, Control.

00:03:07.212 --> 00:03:10.372
Launch pad is being constructed.

00:03:11.652 --> 00:03:13.252
-(GROWLS)
-WOODY: All right, listen up.

00:03:13.332 --> 00:03:16.212
I need Pump Boy here,
Ducky here.

00:03:16.292 --> 00:03:18.972
-Legs, you're with Ducky.
-(QUACKS)

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:22.412
RollerBob and I don't move
'til we get the signal. Clear?

00:03:22.452 --> 00:03:25.932
-(QUACKS)
-Okay. Let's move!

00:03:27.372 --> 00:03:29.292
(BARKS)

00:03:31.892 --> 00:03:34.692
(BARKING CONTINUES)

00:03:42.492 --> 00:03:44.252
(QUACKS)

00:03:46.812 --> 00:03:47.972
Wind the frog.

00:03:54.612 --> 00:03:57.252
-(POP GOES THE WEASEL PLAYING)
-(DOG SNARLS)

00:03:57.372 --> 00:04:00.372
-(CHITTERS)
-(FROG REVS)

00:04:01.532 --> 00:04:04.412
(STRAINING)

00:04:06.772 --> 00:04:09.332
(BIRDS CHIRPING)

00:04:10.172 --> 00:04:12.292
-Wait for the signal.
-(FROG REVS)

00:04:16.172 --> 00:04:18.892
(QUACKS, MUTTERS)

00:04:20.692 --> 00:04:22.852
(MUTTERING)

00:04:25.452 --> 00:04:26.772
(BLUBBERS)

00:04:26.812 --> 00:04:29.172
-(RINGING)
-Go!

00:04:29.492 --> 00:04:31.172
-(GROWLS)
-(ENGINE REVVING)

00:04:31.252 --> 00:04:34.652
-(BARKS)
-All right, let's go!

00:04:35.092 --> 00:04:36.692
HANNAH: I'll get it!

00:04:36.772 --> 00:04:37.972
Now!

00:04:38.652 --> 00:04:40.492
-I'm coming. I'm coming.
-(RINGING CONTINUES)

00:04:40.652 --> 00:04:42.332
-(QUACKS)
-(BARKING CONTINUES)

00:04:43.572 --> 00:04:45.012
(BARKING)

00:04:49.852 --> 00:04:51.532
-(YELPS)
-Scud!

00:04:51.612 --> 00:04:54.132
-(LAUGHING)
-(SNARLS)

00:04:55.212 --> 00:04:57.652
-(BARKS)
-Stupid dog.

00:04:58.572 --> 00:05:00.412
(BARKING CONTINUES)

00:05:05.412 --> 00:05:06.972
Lean back!

00:05:11.292 --> 00:05:14.852
SID: Uh, Mission Control, is
the launch pad construction complete?

00:05:14.932 --> 00:05:17.932
Uh, roger. Rocket is now
secured to guide wire.

00:05:18.012 --> 00:05:21.652
We are currently obtaining
the ignition sticks.

00:05:21.692 --> 00:05:23.412
Countdown will commence
momentarily.

00:05:23.492 --> 00:05:25.772
-Stand by.
-Let's go.

00:05:25.852 --> 00:05:30.052
Hey, Ma! Where are the matches?
Oh, wait. Here they are. Never mind.

00:05:30.172 --> 00:05:32.132
Woody! Great!
Help me outta this thing.

00:05:32.212 --> 00:05:33.972
-Shh!
-What?

00:05:34.052 --> 00:05:36.612
It's okay. Everything's under control.

00:05:38.212 --> 00:05:39.372
(WHISPERING) Woody,
what are you doing?

00:05:39.412 --> 00:05:43.732
Houston. All systems are go.
Requesting permission to launch...

00:05:44.612 --> 00:05:47.092
Hey? How'd you get out here?

00:05:48.772 --> 00:05:51.772
Oh, well. You and I
can have a cookout later.

00:05:51.892 --> 00:05:53.732
(CHUCKLES)

00:05:55.332 --> 00:05:57.572
Houston, do we have
permission to launch?

00:05:57.652 --> 00:06:00.412
(IMITATING RADIO STATIC)
Uh, roger. Permission granted.

00:06:00.492 --> 00:06:04.612
You are confirmed
at "T" minus ten seconds.

00:06:04.692 --> 00:06:08.452
And counting.
Ten, nine,

00:06:08.532 --> 00:06:11.332
eight, seven, six,

00:06:11.412 --> 00:06:14.532
five, four, three, two,

00:06:14.572 --> 00:06:15.652
one!

00:06:15.732 --> 00:06:18.532
WOODY'S VOICE BOX:
Reach for the sky!

00:06:19.092 --> 00:06:20.092
Huh?

00:06:20.172 --> 00:06:23.612
This town ain't big enough
for the two of us.

00:06:23.732 --> 00:06:25.052
What?

00:06:25.092 --> 00:06:27.732
Somebody's poisoned the water hole.

00:06:27.772 --> 00:06:31.772
-It's busted.
-Who are you callin' busted, buster?

00:06:32.012 --> 00:06:33.852
-(WHIMPERS)
-That's right.

00:06:33.932 --> 00:06:37.612
-I'm talking to you, Sid Phillips.
-(GASPS)

00:06:37.692 --> 00:06:40.532
We don't like bein' blown up, Sid,

00:06:40.612 --> 00:06:42.612
or smashed or ripped apart.

00:06:42.652 --> 00:06:46.092
-"We"?
-That's right! Your toys!

00:06:47.052 --> 00:06:48.452
Mama!

00:06:48.932 --> 00:06:50.252
Mama!

00:06:50.812 --> 00:06:53.932
Mama! Mama!

